Each 3-letter subset containing E has the form {X, Y, E} where {X, Y} is a 2-letter subset of U. Remove E from each 3-letter subset to get the corresponding 2-letter subset of U:
{A, B, E} ↔ {A, B}
{A, C, E} ↔ {A, C}
{A, D, E} ↔ {A, D}
{B, C, E} ↔ {B, C}
{B, D, E} ↔ {B, D}
{C, D, E} ↔ {C, D}
